  "description": "IBOFIQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H84 Gd4 N4 O18,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.689-3.899 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.51-109.11°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd4(μ3-OH)2L2(acac)6]·4CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
